---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { posts, readingRoutes } from "../../lib/content.mjs";
const topics = [...new Set(posts.map((p) => p.topic))].sort((a, b) =>
  a.localeCompare(b, "zh"),
);
const counts = {
  all: posts.length,
  articles: posts.filter((p) => p.kind === "articles").length,
  notes: posts.filter((p) => p.kind === "notes").length,
};
---

<Base title="写作 · 林煜轩" section="writing">
  <header class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>写作</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      这里是我的技术手记：从生成式模型到 GPU 内核，从分布式训练到 Agent
      应用。笔记以中文为主，保留英文术语、公式与代码。
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="wrap routes routes-page" aria-labelledby="routes-title">
    <h2 id="routes-title" class="routes-lead">
      从一个问题开始
    </h2>
    <ul>
      {readingRoutes.map((r) => (
        <li>
          <span class="route-q">{r.question}</span>
          <span class="route-links">
            {r.posts.map((p) => (
              <a href={p.url}>{p.title}</a>
            ))}
          </span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap library" data-library aria-labelledby="library-title">
    <h2 id="library-title" class="sr-only">
      全部文字
    </h2>
    <div class="library-bar">
      <form class="search" role="search">
        <label for="search" class="sr-only">
          搜索标题、正文或主题
        </label>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"></circle>
          <path d="m15.5 15.5 5 5"></path>
        </svg>
        <input
          id="search"
          name="q"
          type="search"
          placeholder="搜索标题、正文或主题"
          autocomplete="off"
        />
        <kbd aria-hidden="true">/</kbd>
      </form>
      <fieldset class="segmented">
        <legend class="sr-only">内容类型</legend>
        {[
          ["all", "全部"],
          ["articles", "文章"],
          ["notes", "笔记"],
        ].map(([key, label]) => (
          <label>
            <input
              type="radio"
              name="type"
              value={key}
              checked={key === "all"}
            />
            <span>
              {label}
              <small>{counts[key]}</small>
            </span>
          </label>
        ))}
      </fieldset>
      <label class="topic">
        <span class="sr-only">按主题筛选</span>
        <select name="topic">
          <option value="">所有主题</option>
          {topics.map((t) => (
            <option value={t}>{t}</option>
          ))}
        </select>
      </label>
    </div>
    <div class="library-status">
      <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" data-result-count>
        共 {posts.length} 篇文字
      </p>
      <button type="button" class="link-button" data-retry-search hidden>
        重试全文检索
      </button>
    </div>
    <ul class="entries">
      {posts.map((p) => (
        <li data-entry={p.slug} data-type={p.kind} data-topic={p.topic}>
          <a class="entry" href={p.url}>
            <span class="entry-date">
              {p.date ? p.date.slice(0, 7).replace("-", ".") : "笔记"}
            </span>
            <span class="entry-main">
              <span class="entry-title">{p.title}</span>
              <span class="entry-desc">{p.description}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="entry-meta">
              {p.topic}
              <span>{p.minutes} 分钟</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <div class="empty" hidden>
      <p>没有匹配的文字。试试 CUDA、Flow、并行，或切换到全部主题。</p>
      <button type="button" class="button" data-clear-search>
        清除筛选
      </button>
    </div>
    <noscript>
      <p class="footnote">
        当前展示全部文字。启用 JavaScript 后可以搜索全文并筛选。
      </p>
    </noscript>
    <p class="footnote">
      这些是个人学习笔记，并非课程教材。对于实验结果、实现细节与引用，请以对应论文、源码和官方文档为准。
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
